MEET THE TEAM:

- One of the largest banking companies in the world is testing an AI system to automate their
    mortgage approval process. Abi, the Business Owner, is impressed with the system so far and
    has asked to see key details about the system to better understand it. Abi's request makes the
    team realize that the key details are not clearly documented and therefore not straightforward
    to understand. This story covers what the team did to increase transparency and create a
    standard for documenting details, from the sources of data to how the system makes predictions
    and recommendations.

